function Header({goAdmin,menu,setMenu}:{goAdmin:()=>void;menu:boolean;setMenu:(v:boolean)=>void}){const[tracking,setTracking]=useState(false);return <><header><Brand/><nav className={menu?"open":""}><a href="#fleet">Fleet</a><a href="#booking">How it works</a><a href="#policies">Policies</a><button className="nav-link" onClick={()=>setTracking(true)}>Track booking</button><button onClick={goAdmin}>Staff portal</button></nav><button className="menu" onClick={()=>setMenu(!menu)}><Menu/></button></header>{tracking&&<TrackBooking close={()=>setTracking(false)}/>}</>}
function TrackBooking({close}:{close:()=>void}){const[reference,setReference]=useState(""),[mobile,setMobile]=useState(""),[loading,setLoading]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState(""),[result,setResult]=useState<any|null>(null);async function track(){setLoading(true);setError("");const{data,error}=await createClient().rpc("track_public_booking",{p_booking_reference:reference,p_mobile_number:mobile});setLoading(false);if(error)setError(error.message);else setResult(data)}return <div className="backdrop"><div className="modal tracking-modal"><i><Search/></i><h2>Track your booking</h2><p>Enter the booking reference and the same mobile number used in your request.</p>{!result?<><label>Booking reference<input value={reference} onChange={e=>setReference(e.target.value)} placeholder="CR-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXXXX"/></label><label>Mobile number<input value={mobile} onChange={e=>setMobile(e.target.value)} placeholder="09XX XXX XXXX"/></label>{error&&<p className="form-error">{error}</p>}<footer><button onClick={close}>Cancel</button><button className="primary" disabled={loading||!reference||!mobile} onClick={track}>{loading?"Checking…":"Track booking"}</button></footer></>:<><div className="tracking-result"><small>{result.booking_reference}</small><h3>{result.booking_status.replaceAll("_"," ")}</h3><p>{result.vehicle_name}</p><dl><div><dt>Customer</dt><dd>{result.customer_name}</dd></div><div><dt>Payment</dt><dd>{result.payment_status.replaceAll("_"," ")}</dd></div><div><dt>Release</dt><dd>{new Date(result.pickup_at).toLocaleString("en-PH",{timeZone:"Asia/Manila",dateStyle:"medium",timeStyle:"short"})}</dd></div><div><dt>Expected return</dt><dd>{new Date(result.expected_return_at).toLocaleString("en-PH",{timeZone:"Asia/Manila",dateStyle:"medium",timeStyle:"short"})}</dd></div></dl></div><footer><button onClick={()=>setResult(null)}>Check another</button><button className="primary" onClick={close}>Done</button></footer></>}</div></div>}
function Heading({n,title}:{n:number;title:string}){return <div className="heading"><div><p className="eyebrow">Step {n} of 5</p><h2>{title}</h2></div><span><i/> Live availability</span></div>}
function DocumentUpload({title,front,back,setFront,setBack}:{title:string;front:File|null;back:File|null;setFront:(file:File|null)=>void;setBack:(file:File|null)=>void}){const accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,application/pdf";return <article className="document-upload"><h3>{title}</h3><div><label className={front?"has-file":""}><Plus/><b>Front</b><small>{front?front.name:"Choose file"}</small><input type="file" accept={accept} onChange={e=>setFront(e.target.files?.[0]||null)}/></label><label className={back?"has-file":""}><Plus/><b>Back</b><small>{back?back.name:"Choose file"}</small><input type="file" accept={accept} onChange={e=>setBack(e.target.files?.[0]||null)}/></label></div></article>}
function InspectionForm({odometer,setOdometer,fuel,setFuel,condition,setCondition,notes,setNotes,type}:{odometer:string;setOdometer:(value:string)=>void;fuel:string;setFuel:(value:string)=>void;condition:string;setCondition:(value:string)=>void;notes:string;setNotes:(value:string)=>void;type:"release"|"return"}){return <div className="inspection-form"><div><label>Odometer reading (km)<input type="number" min="0" value={odometer} onChange={e=>setOdometer(e.target.value)}/></label><label>Fuel level (%)<input type="number" min="0" max="100" value={fuel} onChange={e=>setFuel(e.target.value)}/></label></div><label>Overall vehicle condition<select value={condition} onChange={e=>setCondition(e.target.value)}><option value="GOOD">Good</option><option value="FAIR">Fair</option><option value="NEEDS_ATTENTION">Needs attention</option><option value="DAMAGED">Damage observed</option></select></label><label>Inspection notes<textarea value={notes} onChange={e=>setNotes(e.target.value)} placeholder={type==="release"?"Document existing marks, accessories, or release notes":"Document return condition, missing items, fuel, or damage"}/></label><p className="inspection-time"><Clock3/>The actual {type} time will use the authoritative server timestamp when you confirm.</p></div>}
