function Documents(){const[documents,setDocuments]=useState<any[]>([]),[loading,setLoading]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState(""),[busy,setBusy]=useState<string|null>(null);async function load(){setLoading(true);const{data,error}=await createClient().from("customer_documents").select("id,document_type,verification_status,front_storage_path,back_storage_path,created_at,customers!inner(first_name,last_name),bookings(booking_reference)").order("created_at",{ascending:false});if(error)setError(error.message);else setDocuments(data||[]);setLoading(false)}useEffect(()=>{load()},[]);async function view(path:string){setBusy(path);const{data,error}=await createClient().storage.from("customer-documents").createSignedUrl(path,300);setBusy(null);if(error){setError(error.message);return}window.open(data.signedUrl,"_blank","noopener,noreferrer")}async function decide(id:string,status:"VERIFIED"|"REJECTED"){setBusy(id);setError("");const supabase=createClient();const{data:{user}}=await supabase.auth.getUser();const{error}=await supabase.from("customer_documents").update({verification_status:status,verified_by:user?.id||null,verified_at:new Date().toISOString(),rejection_reason:status==="REJECTED"?"Document requires replacement":null}).eq("id",id);setBusy(null);if(error)setError(error.message);else await load()}return <div className="module documents-module"><div className="module-head"><span><h2>Customer document review</h2><p>Private files · signed links expire after five minutes</p></span></div>{loading?<div className="fleet-message">Loading document queue…</div>:error?<div className="fleet-message error">{error}</div>:documents.length===0?<div className="fleet-message">No customer documents submitted yet.</div>:<div className="document-queue">{documents.map(document=><article key={document.id}><div><small>{document.bookings?.booking_reference||"Customer record"}</small><h3>{document.customers.first_name} {document.customers.last_name}</h3><p>{document.document_type.replaceAll("_"," ")}</p></div><em className={`doc-${document.verification_status.toLowerCase()}`}>{document.verification_status.replaceAll("_"," ")}</em><div className="document-files"><button disabled={busy===document.front_storage_path} onClick={()=>view(document.front_storage_path)}>View front</button>{document.back_storage_path&&<button disabled={busy===document.back_storage_path} onClick={()=>view(document.back_storage_path)}>View back</button>}</div><div className="document-actions"><button disabled={busy===document.id} onClick={()=>decide(document.id,"VERIFIED")}><Check/>Verify</button><button disabled={busy===document.id} onClick={()=>decide(document.id,"REJECTED")}><X/>Request replacement</button></div></article>)}</div>}</div>}
function Module({name}:{name:string}){return <div className="empty"><i><Settings/></i><h2>{name}</h2><p>This operational workspace is connected to the same authoritative rental lifecycle and audit trail.</p><button className="primary">Open {name.toLowerCase()} <ArrowRight/></button></div>}
function AdminAccess({goCustomer}:{goCustomer:()=>void}){const[email,setEmail]=useState(""),[password,setPassword]=useState(""),[sessionEmail,setSessionEmail]=useState<string|null>(null),[checking,setChecking]=useState(true),[error,setError]=useState(""),[signingIn,setSigningIn]=useState(false);useEffect(()=>{const supabase=createClient();supabase.auth.getSession().then(({data})=>{setSessionEmail(data.session?.user.email||null);setChecking(false)});const{data:{subscription}}=supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange((_event,session)=>setSessionEmail(session?.user.email||null));return()=>subscription.unsubscribe()},[]);async function login(){setSigningIn(true);setError("");const{error}=await createClient().auth.signInWithPassword({email,password});setSigningIn(false);if(error)setError(error.message)}async function logout(){await createClient().auth.signOut();setSessionEmail(null)}if(checking)return <main className="login"><div className="login-card"><Brand/><p>Checking staff session…</p></div></main>;if(sessionEmail)return <Admin goCustomer={goCustomer} logout={logout} userEmail={sessionEmail}/>;return <main className="login"><div className="login-card"><Brand/><p className="eyebrow">Authorized staff only</p><h1>Staff portal</h1><p>Sign in with your confirmed Supabase owner account.</p><label>Email address<input type="email" value={email} onChange={e=>setEmail(e.target.value)} autoComplete="email"/></label><label>Password<input type="password" value={password} onChange={e=>setPassword(e.target.value)} autoComplete="current-password"/></label>{error&&<p className="form-error">{error}</p>}<button className="primary" disabled={signingIn||!email||!password} onClick={login}>{signingIn?"Signing in…":"Sign in"}<ArrowRight/></button><button className="secondary" onClick={goCustomer}>Return to customer site</button></div></main>}
export default function Home(){const[admin,setAdmin]=useState(false);return admin?<AdminAccess goCustomer={()=>setAdmin(false)}/>:<Customer goAdmin={()=>setAdmin(true)}/>}
